    <div class="modal-body">
      <div class="tipout-payout-confirm-grid">
        <span>门店</span><strong id="detailPayoutStore">—</strong>
        <span>营业日期</span><strong id="detailPayoutDate">—</strong>
        <span>已分配金额（参考）</span><strong id="detailPayoutAmount">—</strong>
        <span>涉及员工</span><strong id="detailPayoutEmployees">—</strong>
      </div>
      <p class="tipout-payout-warning"><strong>本操作仅记录发放状态，不执行转账。确认后分配结果锁定；仅可通过汇总页“取消分配”演示重置，撤销标记不会撤回实际付款。</strong></p>
    </div>
